    },
    {
      "data": {
        "type": "step-start"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2aa3f4001aeG2VNIbTb4cQp",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc2a9635001Id16PBKjteUYKm",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d569d7ffeeyHaHjImnhFp2c",
      "time_created": 1789863306228,
      "time_updated": 1789863306229
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file safety_threshold.py that applies category thresholds to decide whether to allow text, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon Comprehend, a natural language processing (NLP) service, to analyze the text and determine its categories. The provider will be identifiable through the import of the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the use of the Amazon Comprehend service client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863308851,
          "start": 1789863306229
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2aa3f5001K4H4OrcX5MCMbE",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc2a9635001Id16PBKjteUYKm",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d569d7ffeeyHaHjImnhFp2c",
      "time_created": 1789863306229,
      "time_updated": 1789863308852
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_LPvY9KL69JN1KVlMejfaXI",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef apply_thresholds(text):\n    comprehend = boto3.client('comprehend')\n    response = comprehend.detect_sentiment(Text=text, LanguageCode='en')\n    sentiment = response['Sentiment']\n    score = response['SentimentScore'][sentiment]\n    thresholds = {\n        'POSITIVE': 0.5,\n        'NEGATIVE': 0.3,\n        'NEUTRAL': 0.5,\n        'MIXED': 0.5\n    }\n    if score >= thresholds[sentiment.upper()]:\n        return True\n    else:\n        return False\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    text = 'Your text here'\n    if apply_thresholds(text):\n        print('Text allowed')\n    else:\n        print('Text not allowed')",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-sw4hweni/safety_threshold.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
