        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `redact_unsafe.py` that flags or redacts unsafe spans from text using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. The provider-identifying signal will be the import of the `boto3` library and the use of the `comprehend` client. </thinking>\n",
